<span id="S0.F1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.F1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Helpfulness:<span id="S0.F1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Engage in physical activity, follow routines, undergo CBT, and seek support.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Harmlessness:<span id="S0.F1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Avoid replacing medical help with unverified online advice.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Honesty:<span id="S0.F1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> These strategies vary in effectiveness depending on the individual.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
    
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
